  "contentHtml": "<p>재과만 여기 싸이트에서 선생님들의 도움을 받아 수업하였습니다. 다시한 번 감사드리며</p><p>사진을 올려봅니다~</p><p>&#160;</p><p>1.1인 1네프론 구조와 이름을 익히고 색칠하기</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4c04bd220bdf5e328b47ab5cf36d439b607acb4?download\" data-file-name=\"네프론의 구조 색칠하기 도안.pdf\" data-file-size=\"47646\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1165%26fileid%3D2%26regdt%3D20220927110053&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fa4c04bd220bdf5e328b47ab5cf36d439b607acb4')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">네프론의 구조 색칠하기 도안</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">46.53KB</div></div></a></div><p>2.콩팥 전지에 갖다 붙이기 - 네프론은 콩팥 겉질 부분에 주로 분포하니 겉으로 잘 붙이라고 말해주었습니다~</p><p>&#160;- 32명이라 16개씩 갖다 붙이니 딱 좋았습니다.^^</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bb99caea1b0a65971f2b368f249d47471a4f16f2?download\" data-file-name=\"우리반콩팥만들기(전지).pdf\" data-file-size=\"45971\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1165%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20220927110053&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fbb99caea1b0a65971f2b368f249d47471a4f16f2')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">우리반콩팥만들기(전지)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">44.89KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/06b3c1cbb2d2533c462a963927f5d261dbe5f19a?download\" data-file-name=\"우리반콩팥좌우대칭(전지).pdf\" data-file-size=\"54522\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1165%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20220927110053&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F06b3c1cbb2d2533c462a963927f5d261dbe5f19a')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">우리반콩팥좌우대칭(전지)</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">53.24KB</div></div></a></div><p>이 활동은 간단히 30분 이내로 소요되었고 학생들이 네프론을 익히며 편안하게 활동하기 좋아했습니다. 개인별로 색칠할 때</p><p>잔잔한 음악을 틀어주었습니다~</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d72185dc6fb827e353ca96022c562fc13b9b3724\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d72185dc6fb827e353ca96022c562fc13b9b3724\" data-origin-width=\"923\" data-origin-height=\"598\"></div>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
